===''Pokémon the Series''===
[[File:Marley anime.png|thumb|150px|Marley in {{aniseries|DP}}]]
====''Pokémon the Series: Diamond and Pearl''====
Marley debuted in ''[[DP168|Keeping In Top Forme!]]''. She was spotted unconscious floating down a river in a boat by {{an|Brock}}. He called out to her, trying to warn her of an oncoming waterfall, but she did not respond. He jumped in the river to stop the boat, before using {{TP|Brock|Happiny}} to pull them out of the water. Afterwards, Marley finally woke up and introduced herself.

Because Brock saved her, Marley asked him to escort her to a flower field. {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} eventually discovered that Marley was harboring an injured {{p|Shaymin}}. She explained that she was approached by Shaymin because it was being attacked by [[Team Rocket trio|a trio of thugs]] who wanted to take it.

Marley eventually got to the flower field that had [[Gracidea]] flowers, and Shaymin was about to transform into its {{fd|Shaymin|Sky Forme}}. There, it defeated Team Rocket and was reunited with its friends. Marley bid Shaymin farewell. As Shaymin left, Marley informed Ash and {{ashfr}} that it said goodbye to her telepathically.

